# downstream tasks (prog_mass_, subhalo_), <target_columns>_<dataset_size>/
# for the pretraining datasets (3d_proxy_*, 3d_x_y_z_eigenvalues_*). None of
# their contents is tracked as files: the per-run results the figure notebook
# needs are tracked as results_archive.tar.gz at the repo root, with the same
# folder layout (built by scripts/make_results_archive.sh).
